{"id":"a4c7e2b9-3d18-4f6a-8b52-9e1c7d3f8a64","revision":0,"last_node_id":212,"last_link_id":16,"nodes":[{"id":11,"type":"FallingTSNote","pos":[40,574],"size":[660,1620],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"使用说明","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"FallingTSNote","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["## 环境音效 · Stable Audio Open 1.0\n\n**引擎**: Stable Audio Open 1.0（Stability AI）· **全程原生节点，无需插件**\n**权重**: `stable-audio-open-1.0.safetensors` 4.85 GB\n**编码器**: `t5-base.safetensors` 892 MB（**必需**，见下）\n**输出**: 44.1 kHz 立体声\n\n### 三个引擎怎么选\n\n| 工作流 | 引擎 | 谱平坦度 | 15 秒耗时 | 特点 |\n|------|------|---------|----------|------|\n| `0061_环境音效` | MMAudio V2 | **0.063** | 33 秒 | 综合最稳，**默认首选** |\n| **00610（本文件）** | Stable Audio Open | 0.617 | 21 秒 | 最快，但**平坦度偏高、偏噪声** |\n| `00611_环境音效HVF` | HunyuanVideo-Foley | 0.071 | 344 秒 | 低频最厚，但慢 10 倍 |\n\n> ⚠️ **本模型做环境音效是短板**。它的训练语料以音乐与歌曲为主，纯环境音表现不稳：\n> 实测 8/15/30 秒平坦度在 **0.269~0.617** 间剧烈波动，重心 4520~7014 Hz 偏刺耳。\n> 已试过原生 47 秒 + cfg 4.5/7.0 + euler/ddim_uniform 全部组合，平坦度最低仍 0.305。\n> **建议**：音乐/节拍类走 `0060_背景音乐`；环境音优先用 `0061`。\n\n### 提示词怎么写\n\n写在左侧 **`音效提示词`** / **`负向提示词`**（`PrimitiveStringMultiline`），秒数由 **`秒数`**（`PrimitiveFloat`）控制。\n\n| 参数节点 | 接到 | 说明 |\n|------|------|------|\n| `音效提示词` | `CLIPTextEncode`(正) → `ConditioningStableAudio.positive` | **必须英文** |\n| `负向提示词` | `CLIPTextEncode`(负) → `ConditioningStableAudio.negative` | 排除项 |\n| `秒数` | `ConditioningStableAudio.seconds_total` + `EmptyLatentAudio.seconds` | **两处都要接，必须同值** |\n\n### 两个必须知道的坑\n\n**① 单文件权重不含 T5，必须单独加载**\n\n`stable-audio-open-1.0.safetensors` 只有一个 `conditioner.*`（时间嵌入），**没有文本编码器**。\n所有 prompt 全靠 `CLIPLoader` 载入的 `t5-base.safetensors`（type 必须选 `stable_audio`）。\n\n**② `seconds_total` 和 `EmptyLatentAudio.seconds` 必须一致**\n\n前者告诉模型「总长多少」，后者决定实际生成的 latent 长度。**两者不一致会导致音频被截断或后半段是噪声**。\n本工作流已用同一个 `秒数` 节点同时驱动两处，不会错。\n\n### 关键参数\n\n| 参数 | 当前 | 说明 |\n|------|------|------|\n| `steps` | 100 | 官方推荐 |\n| `cfg` | 7.0 | 官方默认 |\n| `sampler_name` | euler | 别再换，实测 ddim_uniform 更差 |\n| `scheduler` | simple | 官方默认 |\n| `denoise` | 1.0 | 全量生成 |\n\n### 链路\n\n`CheckpointLoaderSimple`（ckpt，取第 3 输出 VAE）\n+ `CLIPLoader`（`t5-base` / `stable_audio`）\n→ `CLIPTextEncode`×2 → `ConditioningStableAudio`\n+ `EmptyLatentAudio`\n→ `KSampler` → `VAEDecodeAudio` → `NormalizeAudioLoudness (-20 LUFS)` → `SaveAudioAdvanced`\n\n产物落 `output/环境音效SAO_00001.flac`。\n\n### 速查\n\n| 症状 | 对策 |\n|------|------|\n| 报错找不到 CLIP / 文本不生效 | `CLIPLoader` 的 type 必须选 `stable_audio` |\n| 音频后半段是噪声 | `seconds_total` 与 `EmptyLatentAudio.seconds` 不一致 |\n| 结果平坦像白噪声 | 该模型环境音本就如此，换 `0061` 的 MMAudio |\n| 想要更响/更安静 | 改 205 的 `lufs`（-23 广播 / -20 素材 / -14 短视频） |\n| 结果不满意 | 换 seed；或把 `秒数` 改到 47（原生训练时长）略好 |"]},{"id":2,"type":"PrimitiveStringMultiline","pos":[40,2254],"size":[440,220],"flags":{},"order":1,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[{"name":"STRING","type":"STRING","slot_index":0,"links":[1]}],"title":"音效提示词（英文）","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"PrimitiveStringMultiline"},"widgets_values":["A sunlit mountain forest. Wind moving through the trees, leaves rustling in the breeze, birds chirping, a wild animal growling in the distance."]},{"id":3,"type":"PrimitiveStringMultiline","pos":[780,88],"size":[440,160],"flags":{},"order":2,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[{"name":"STRING","type":"STRING","slot_index":0,"links":[2]}],"title":"负向提示词","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"PrimitiveStringMultiline"},"widgets_values":["noisy, harsh, static, hiss, hum, buzz, clicking, clipping, distorted, muffled, low quality, music, melody, singing, human voice, speech, narration, echo, traffic, city noise, engine, machinery"]},{"id":4,"type":"PrimitiveFloat","pos":[780,308],"size":[440,110],"flags":{},"order":3,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[{"name":"FLOAT","type":"FLOAT","slot_index":0,"links":[3,4]}],"title":"秒数","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"PrimitiveFloat"},"widgets_values":[15]},{"id":5,"type":"CheckpointLoaderSimple","pos":[